fail_closed.py with 10 edge/E2E nodes is physically held at /tmp/rebar-b2-heldout-test_init_fail_closed.py and declared off-limits. Worker brief includes the 800 LOC hard cap, Ruff/type constraints, named 10s probe bound, and requires attempt count.","timestamp":1785628185941725001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"B2 held-out validation GREEN: initial restore produced 9 pass/1 test-defect; corrected exact-wording assertion under revert-first discipline and proved the corrected oracle RED against blind orphan bootstrap. Full held-out+happy suite is now 14 passed. Defect-seeded mutations restoring timeout orphan-bootstrap and treating advertised as absent both went RED. Review then found and fixed post-call TTL anchoring, a bounded 128-entry cache, one shared bounded Git runner, preserved module design docs, and remote/branch/10s strict diagnostics. Focused affected suites: 66 passed. Pre-flight: make lint PASS, make typecheck PASS (406 files), make test PASS (8485 passed, 39 skipped, 174 deselected in 33m20s). Security/performance review: argv-only Git invocation, validated config names, 10s probe bound, 300s fetch bound preserved, one cached probe across best-effort/strict, bounded cache.","timestamp":1785634750132062001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Committed B2 as f4064aa4967669cf30c81cabe63a20c907eb492d with rebar-ticket trailer, DCO sign-off, and Change-Id Iac011616eb30e3c6961ef5f08e89d18f13f38ed6. Commit hooks passed lint, mypy, message wrap, and structural checks. Worktree clean; pushing one independent Gerrit change to refs/for/main.","timestamp":1785634808588042001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Gerrit 1198 green on patchset 1: LLM-Review +1, Verified +1, zero unresolved comments. GitHub Verified run 30727467623 complete